function gridMesh(n,m,fn){let v=[],idx=[];for(let j=0;j<=m;j++)for(let i=0;i<=n;i++){let q=fn(i/n,j/m);v.push(...q.p,...q.n,i/n,j/m,...(q.c||[1,1,1]));}for(let j=0;j<m;j++)for(let i=0;i<n;i++){let a=j*(n+1)+i,b=a+n+1;idx.push(a,b,a+1,a+1,b,b+1)}return {v,idx}}
